During the Burgle Battle the player can collect up to 3 spirits from [[God (Special Cat)|God Cat]]. These spirits allow the player to upgrade their various abilities at the '''Prayer''' (お祈り).
There are 4 type of spirits: Yellow, Blue, Red and Rainbow:

